  "releaseNotes": "v3.240.97:\n\t\t- Fixed: on a portal with an Alerts Health Check report, reading the list of reports threw\n\t\t  NotSupportedException (\"ReportConverter.cs needs updating to include alertshealthcheck\n\t\t  reports\"), failing the whole list rather than just that report. The new\n\t\t  AlertsHealthCheckReport models the type from a live portal's response: an alert report's\n\t\t  filters under different field names, and columns, with dateRange from DateRangeReport.\n\t\t- AlertForecastReport gains topN.\n\t\t- Every report on the affected portal, 40 in all, now reads with both the Release and the\n\t\t  strict Debug settings.",
